3z004" style=3D"color:#192733" data-hs-link-id=3D"0" data-hs-link-id-v2=3D"=
jrOcvzFE" target=3D"_blank">Only 31% of Americans have a will</a>, and 55% =
have no estate plan at all, according to a 2025 survey by Trust &amp; Will.=
&nbsp;</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%">&nbsp;</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%; font-weight:bold; font-size:18px">Why is that=
?</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%">&nbsp;</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%">Conventional estate planning can be inconveni=
ent and expensive. And it traditionally leans on kids' involvement, so it's=
 struggled to keep pace with emerging trends and demographic shifts =E2=80=
=94 including longer lifespans and more child-free adults.&nbsp;</p>
<ul style=3D"line-height:150%">
<li aria-level=3D"1">We're also on the cusp of the largest generational wea=
lth transfer in history.<br><br></li>
<li aria-level=3D"1">&nbsp;An <a href=3D"https://media.hubspot.com/e3t/Ctc/=
UB+113/d2q-Vf04/VVv-1C15tYYRW5P_0xl3X072xW2x7JLQ5Jy-dKMyCDmM2-ZW0W7Y8-PT6lZ=
3pVW6x3Sff8Q3pHgVr7ftq2sDd37W939fWW5-LfV-W7tWvkr8zndwVW22BDTx9jrfbgW6W7M223=
y-C0GN2jkPt1wcg_dW1gQRS3729CBDVh2t8S8gZkGKW3Ns8Pz1pnDMFW6PX2Cv8M75njW9f2HhD=
3bjr_fW5YTPb764nyP-W8F2gfm5T540FVxcBcR45TRS4W3cl3NL57fRjdW6Q0PJm2hRSJ3VKNZx=
f4NBZzsW5w81mn51SfDxW8DzZzH6sbrZWW5NQGRs2n7QkmW2fpCGl6q6x4YW7bjVP334h7N4W7C=
vPTH5lDnDYW4F7Nrd26LWPQN30wGb71WvpcdzMW2-04" style=3D"color:#192733" data-h=
s-link-id=3D"0" data-hs-link-id-v2=3D"NqaqWCcz" target=3D"_blank">estimated=
 $124T</a> is expected to be inherited between 2024&nbsp;and 2048.</li>
</ul>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%">That means an unfathomable amount of wealth i=
s about to pass through an inaccessible legacy process =E2=80=94 AKA the ki=
nd of situation entrepreneurs dream of.&nbsp;</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%">&nbsp;</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%; font-weight:bold; font-size:18px">There are s=
till skeptics</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%">&nbsp;</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%">AI always raises concerns over accuracy, but =
that's especially relevant in estate planning. Even small mistakes can have=
 life-altering consequences, so some critics and consumers are understandab=
ly anxious.&nbsp;</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%">&nbsp;</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%">Also, some of these services run on subscript=
ion models, meaning living too long could make one-time document creation m=
ore cost-effective.&nbsp;</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%">&nbsp;</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%">Regardless, you can officially brace for life=
 after death from the comfort of your couch =E2=80=94 and an industry is em=
erging around finding easier ways to make you a better-prepared, more respo=
nsible dead person.</p>
